    "Code of conduct": "行为准则",
    "Applies to everyone at the summit — delegates, speakers, exhibitors, partners, media and staff.": "适用于峰会的所有人员——代表、演讲者、参展商、合作伙伴、媒体和工作人员。",
    "This summit brings together people from different countries, industries, languages and levels of seniority. The point is that they can do business with each other. That requires a floor of behaviour everyone can rely on.": "本次峰会汇聚了来自不同国家、行业、语言和资历级别的人士。其宗旨是让他们能够彼此开展业务。这需要一个人人都可以信赖的行为底线。",
    "What is expected": "行为期望",
    "Treat everyone professionally, whatever their nationality, seniority, gender, age, religion, disability or first language.": "以专业态度对待每一个人,无论其国籍、资历、性别、年龄、宗教信仰、残疾状况或母语为何。",
    "Assume a language barrier is a barrier, not a shortcoming. Speak plainly and give people time.": "将语言障碍视为一种障碍,而非缺陷。请使用简明语言,并给予他人充足时间。",
    "Respect a \"no\" the first time, whether it is about a meeting, a photograph or a conversation.": "首次听到\"不\"时即予以尊重,无论涉及会面、拍照或交谈。",
    "Follow the venue's safety instructions and staff directions.": "遵守会场的安全指示和工作人员的指引。",
    "What is not tolerated": "不容忍的行为",
    "Harassment of any kind, including unwanted physical contact, persistent unwanted attention, or comments targeting who someone is rather than what they said.": "任何形式的骚扰,包括不受欢迎的身体接触、持续的不受欢迎关注,或针对他人身份而非其言论的评论。",
    "Intimidating, threatening or abusive behaviour.": "恐吓、威胁或辱骂行为。",
    "Photographing or recording someone who has asked you not to.": "在他人要求不要拍摄或录制的情况下仍进行拍摄或录制。",
    "Deliberately disrupting sessions or the exhibition.": "故意扰乱会议或展览。",
    "Misrepresenting your organisation, your authority to transact, or your relationship to the summit.": "虚假陈述您的机构、您的交易权限或您与峰会的关系。",
    "Reporting a concern": "报告关切事项",
    "During the summit, tell any member of summit staff — they are briefed to act, not to mediate. Before or after, use the <a href=\"/contact/\">contact form</a> and mark it as a conduct concern. Reports are treated confidentially, and being the person who raises one will never be held against you.": "峰会期间,请告知任何一位峰会工作人员——他们接受过培训,会采取行动而非调解。峰会前后,请使用<a href=\"/contact/\">联系表单</a>并标注为行为准则关切事项。报告将被严格保密,提出报告的行为绝不会对您造成不利影响。",
    "Consequences": "后果",
    "The secretariat may issue a warning, remove someone from a session, withdraw exhibition or accreditation privileges, or remove someone from the venue. Serious matters are referred to the appropriate authorities.": "秘书处可发出警告、将某人逐出会场、撤销展览或认证特权,或将某人逐出场地。严重事项将移交相关主管部门处理。",
    "Named contacts": "指定联系人",
